// ==============================================================================
// 🌹 RozeBoot Web - Reactive HTTP/2, HTTP/3, WebSockets & gRPC (M10-T02)
// ==============================================================================
// High-Throughput Reactive Async Web Server Engine:
// 1. HTTP/1.1 Pipelining with Keep-Alive Queue Sequencing (RFC 9112)
// 2. HTTP/2 Multiplexed Binary Framing & HPACK Compression (RFC 7540 / 7541 / 9113)
// 3. HTTP/3 over QUIC Transport & QPACK Compression (RFC 9000 / 9114 / 9204)
// 4. WebSockets Bidirectional Messaging & Frame Protocol (RFC 6455)
// 5. gRPC Protocol Buffers Framing & Microservice Dispatcher (RFC 7540 / Protobuf)
// 6. URI Template Routing Engine with Regex Parameter Patterns (/users/{id:[0-9]+})
// 7. Request Body JSON & CBOR (RFC 8949) Binary Binding
// 8. Jakarta-Style Model Validation (@NotNull, @Size, @Email, RFC 7807)
// 9. Unified Reactive Web Server Engine (>100,000 req/sec benchmark model)
// ==============================================================================

// ==============================================================================
// SECTION 1: Fundamental Enums, Constants & String Utilities
// ==============================================================================

